    "created_at": "2017-06-07T21:25:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-07T21:25:02Z",
    "body": "Do you happen to know the difference between `dragexit` and `dragleave`? A quick reading of [the spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html) seems to suggest they're effectively the same event.\r\n\r\nI don't know why we chose not to implement `dragexit` in the past. I'd consider implementing the event, given a better understanding of its purpose and the value it adds over `dragleave`.",
