    "created_at": "2017-06-15T11:49:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-15T11:49:43Z",
    "body": "Per spec, the `dragexit` event is only fired here:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#drag-and-drop-processing-model:event-dnd-dragexit\r\n\r\n`dragleave` is fired here:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#drag-and-drop-processing-model:event-dnd-dragleave\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#drag-and-drop-processing-model:event-dnd-dragleave-2",
